Kept so git tracks this directory.
Without it a fresh clone has no ./logs, and Docker creates a missing
bind-mount source as root:root 0755. MapProxy runs as MAPPROXY_USER_ID=1000
and could not create its log files there, so fileConfig would fail at start.
The directory itself is the only thing that needs to exist and be owned by
the host user; the log files inside it are ignored.
